WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.200
-Finally, guys, I was
watching TV the other day.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.634
I was just flipping
through the channels

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.067
and I came across
this show on TeenNick.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.667
It's called "Ew!"

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:09.234
And it's a pretty good show.

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:11.667
And a lot of people say that
I look like the main character.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:12.834
I don't know
if I see it, though.

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.367
But, anyways, here,
look for yourselves.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.467
Here's the latest
episode of "Ew!"

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:23.701
♪♪

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:25.667
Hi, everyone!

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:29.167
Welcome to "Ew!"
My name is Sara.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:32.367
And if you're wondering,
that's S-A-R-A with no "H,"

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:34.501
because H's are ew!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.767
Joining me today is the
new foreign exchange student

00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:42.234
who just moved in across
the street, Bjergen Kjergen.

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.467
Hi, Bjergen.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:46.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:48.234
Hi, Bjergen.

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:50.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.501
-[ Swedish accent ] Hi!
-Hi. How's it going?

00:00:56.501 --> 00:01:00.300
-Pretty good, yeah.
It's great to be on you.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.167
-Yeah. I love your pigtails.
Did you braid them yourself?

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.934
-No. They were done by
my sisters,

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:09.601
Herdie, Kerdie, and Donna.

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:12.067
-Yeah. Well, they look amazing.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:14.901
So, Bjergen, are you ready for
the school dance competition

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:15.968
next week?

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:17.601
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:20.834
But I'm also a bit nervous,
you know?

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:24.400
I've never danced in front
of other people before.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.567
-Ew! Don't be shy. It's easy.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:29.767
We can practice
the dance together right now.

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.934
I'm going to put it on TikTok.

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:36.968
-♪ You turn me on
like a light switch ♪

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:40.133
♪ When you're movin' your body
around and around ♪

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.334
♪ Now, I don't wanna
fight this ♪

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.567
♪ You know how to
just make me want ♪

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:45.734
♪ You turn me...♪

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:49.067
-Let's see if it went viral.

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:53.234
It only has seven likes. Ew!

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:56.467
That's not a lot of likes.

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:57.534
-What?

00:01:57.534 --> 00:02:01.067
-I said,
it's not a lot of likes.

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:03.801
-Oh! I's not a lot of likes.

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:06.467
-Yeah, yeah.
Anyway, let's play a game.

00:02:06.467 --> 00:02:08.167
What's your favorite game,
Bjergen?

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:11.067
-Well, in my country,
we have a game, yeah.

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:14.801
It's called the floor
is a fluva.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:19.167
-Is that like the floor is lava?

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:22.701
-Yeah, but we
call it a fluva.

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:24.601
-Can two people play
it together?

00:02:24.601 --> 00:02:28.033
-Oh, does a pjerp wear a hjerp?

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:34.767
-Yes?

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:37.000
-Yeah. Of course. Let's do it.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.534
-We can put this on TikTok, too!

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:40.200
-Okay.

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:42.801
-Here we go.

00:02:42.801 --> 00:02:45.033
-Ready? Yeah.
-Ready? Alright, go.

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:49.067
Here we go.
-Yeah.

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:52.601
Bjergen, the floor is floggon.

00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:55.567
The floor is -- I'm gonna go
for the slide tackle.

00:02:56.834 --> 00:02:59.868
Oh, my --
-Are you okay?

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:02.868
-What is going on down here?

00:03:02.868 --> 00:03:05.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:08.400
You guys doing some parkour?

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.801
Hey, check it out.
I got some moves of my own.

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:15.634
365 degrees, 24/7.

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:18.601
-Ew! That's my stepdad, Gary.

00:03:18.601 --> 00:03:19.901
Get out of here, Gary!

00:03:19.901 --> 00:03:22.167
-Hey, come on. You girls
are making some TikTaks?

00:03:22.167 --> 00:03:23.901
Have you seen that new A.I.?

00:03:23.901 --> 00:03:28.033
♪ Hash brown like ChatBLT ♪

00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:29.367
-Ew!

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:32.667
-Anyway, if you like
cinnamon buns, hun, your mother

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:35.501
and I are upstairs making
some gluten-free pastries.

00:03:35.501 --> 00:03:39.167
And this just in --
I have a sensitivity.

00:03:39.167 --> 00:03:42.300
♪ If you want a sweet treat
that's safe to eat ♪

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.167
♪ You gotta make sure
it doesn't have any wheat ♪

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:48.667
♪ A-take a big bite
and a munch, munch, munch ♪

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:51.534
♪ Pastries for breakfast,
dinner, and snack time ♪

00:03:51.534 --> 00:03:53.067
♪ Munch, munchie ♪

00:03:53.067 --> 00:03:54.601
♪ Munchie, munch ♪

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:57.200
♪ Munch, munch, munch, munch,
a-muchidy, munch ♪

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.367
♪ You spell "munch" backwards,
it still spells "munch" ♪

00:04:00.367 --> 00:04:02.601
-Ew! Gary, get out of here!

00:04:02.601 --> 00:04:04.767
Come on!
-I had one more.

00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:08.467
Catch it on the flippity-flop!
-Come on!

00:04:08.467 --> 00:04:10.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:10.934 --> 00:04:14.701
Okay, it's time for the "Ew!"
Speed Round, okay? Ready?

00:04:14.701 --> 00:04:16.133
-Oh. Okay.

00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:17.767
-Here we go.

00:04:17.767 --> 00:04:19.000
"Minecraft."

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.601
-Ew!

00:04:22.834 --> 00:04:23.834
-Jibbitz.

00:04:23.834 --> 00:04:25.968
-Ew!

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.567
-Capybaras.

00:04:28.567 --> 00:04:31.100
-[ Laughs ] Ew!

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:34.000
-Fjallraven backpacks.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.767
-Uh...ew!

00:04:35.767 --> 00:04:38.567
My cousin makes those.

00:04:38.567 --> 00:04:40.567
[ Laughs ]

00:04:43.601 --> 00:04:45.367
-John Leguizamo.

00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:47.534
-Cute!

00:04:47.534 --> 00:04:49.200
-Wait. Really?

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:53.000
-Yeah! He's, like,
really talented, you know?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.467
Have you ever seen
"To Wong Foo,

00:04:56.467 --> 00:04:59.634
Thanks for Everything!
Julie Newmar"?

00:04:59.634 --> 00:05:04.534
-"To Wong Foo

00:05:04.534 --> 00:05:07.567
Thanks for Everything!

00:05:07.567 --> 00:05:10.234
Julie Newmar"?

00:05:10.234 --> 00:05:11.367
-Yeah.

00:05:11.367 --> 00:05:13.467
-No, never heard of it.
-Oh. Alright.

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:16.567
[ Cellphone chimes ]
-Oh, look.

00:05:16.567 --> 00:05:19.767
Bjergen, our dance is getting
a lot of likes.

00:05:19.767 --> 00:05:21.300
We're going viral!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.767
-Oh, that's good.

00:05:23.767 --> 00:05:25.868
-I'm getting a FaceTime!

00:05:25.868 --> 00:05:27.701
From "Spam Likely."

00:05:27.701 --> 00:05:29.901
-Oh.
-I'm going to answer it.

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:32.067
-Yeah?
-Hello?

00:05:32.067 --> 00:05:35.133
-Hey, Sara. Hey, Bjergen.

00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:36.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:36.534 --> 00:05:38.434
-O-M-jeans!

00:05:38.434 --> 00:05:41.534
It's Charlie Puth!

00:05:41.534 --> 00:05:45.634
-Charlie Puth, I love you.

00:05:45.634 --> 00:05:47.334
-I just wanted to say
I saw your video.

00:05:47.334 --> 00:05:48.701
I love your moves.

00:05:48.701 --> 00:05:50.300
So I want to offer you both

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.367
front-row tickets
to my next show.

00:05:52.367 --> 00:05:54.067
-Front-row seats?!

00:05:54.067 --> 00:05:56.834
What is life?! What is life?!

00:05:56.834 --> 00:05:58.200
This is crazy!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.767
-Yeah. It's crazy!

00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:02.467
-That's all the time
we have for "Ew!"

00:06:02.467 --> 00:06:05.400
I want to thank Bjergen
for joining us tonight.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.968
Tune in next week. Ew!

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:09.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:09.734 --> 00:06:15.033
♪♪

00:06:15.033 --> 00:06:19.334
My thanks to Drew Barrymore
and Charlie Puth.

00:06:19.334 --> 00:06:21.868
You can catch him on the
Charlie Live Experience tour

00:06:21.868 --> 00:06:22.968
this summer.

